{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:30 2026-10-27 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨8歲大女「小飯兜」越大越靚  五官精緻如洋娃娃  JJ為一事又發文公審老公樊少皇\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/929433273ff008d1dd2f4c4be74c05cd/2026-10/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_178.png\"/>\n<p>44歲的JJ賈曉晨與武打影星老公樊少皇結婚多年，育有兩名寶貝女兒，8歲的大女「小飯兜」自幼便因洋娃娃般的美貌備受關注。日前賈曉晨在社交平台分享一家四口到北京環球影城的相片，從近照可見，小飯兜完美繼承了母親的回族優良美貌基因，精緻的鵝蛋臉上，長有一雙深邃靈動的大眼睛，睫毛濃密纖長，配上高挺小巧的鼻樑，粉嫩的櫻桃小嘴以及白皙剔透的肌膚，五官比例近乎完美。當日她紮起俏皮雙馬尾，身穿粉色毛毛外套配碎花裙，眼角貼上閃爍的紅色亮片水鑽點綴，對著鏡頭展露優雅甜美的小美人氣場，引來網民紛紛讚她「最美星二代」、「完美遺傳媽咪神級基因」。</p>\n<h2>JJ賈曉晨指老公入鬼屋呻攰</h2>\n<p>賈曉晨一家四口特意前往挑戰萬聖節鬼屋，怎料歡樂背後，賈曉晨再一次忍不住在社交平台發文大吐苦水，公審老公樊少皇的連串「大頭蝦」行徑，指責老公「忘記帶證件，忘記帶自己包包，忘記給我帶水等等等，啥都忘！」賈曉晨指老公僅僅陪逛了一間鬼屋後，就體力不支直呼「好攰」，加上細女「小飯糰」覺得害怕，父女倆迅速投降，賈曉晨只有帶著大女小飯兜連闖剩下的4間鬼屋。</p>\n<img alt=\"來自內地的賈曉晨2006年來港發展。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f2633615281d078f655afdb10bb4797/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_26_09_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨參加TVB《美女廚房》成為「美少女廚神冠軍」，亦曾任「味之天使」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ebdb4047fb9e5efc7cf06442039641f/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_26_08_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨最為人熟悉的是上《獎門人》啜乒乓波。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b03a86b2532c8f2a177e0303952ef925/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_26_07_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨呢一幕好經典。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4fa6554e3fcf65b7f0ef958493ca706d/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_26_07_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨指住戴骷髏面罩的老公樊少皇，笑稱「就是他」大頭蝦兼玩鬼屋嗌攰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7fd82329b5d0779038d768e59faa413b/2026-10/_1_JJ___.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"8歲大女小飯兜五官標緻，一雙洋娃娃大眼睛極具仙氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f561df30815519d2f00f2e74283c5d4b/2026-10/SaveClip_App_864735982_18378112393300923_8628667794563906729_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨與小飯兜同框合照，兩母女似足餅印。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3632670e76a3aeb80ae7b97eacfa8f38/2026-10/SaveClip_App_869276688_18378112435300923_910266100623072182_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"細女小飯糰造型可愛飲熱飲，玩完一間鬼屋後嚇到嗌驚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c562ad8bc5809c21f896aabde0270e9/2026-10/SaveClip_App_866525935_18378112408300923_5909994857074978308_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨與小飯兜齊齊嘟嘴自拍，大女仙氣十足兼大膽無懼鬼屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41d0e633d2b2c725cd4903ec6de5f01e/2026-10/SaveClip_App_866957926_18378112420300923_5044123638162657244_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨眼角貼上閃鑽點綴，保養得宜凍齡如少女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d20ce139715d83cf46dab0fff915ce4f/2026-10/SaveClip_App_869106720_18378112480300923_440915496478416270_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"北京環球影城夜景璀璨，JJ與家人共度萬聖節時光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1aaf7d3be046dcedfba48410bb34e2b8/2026-10/SaveClip_App_869428012_18378112591300923_2973022052748532469_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨無奈自拍，指老公出門竟然忘記帶證件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/74e02d3e8c74a93041194ccf66b9ebdd/2026-10/SaveClip_App_869798460_18378112426300923_1762478560776301173_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"環球影城萬聖節主題區「松齡街」，吸引大批遊客排隊挑戰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db5548b37cabec31052c362eaf76abf1/2026-10/SaveClip_App_869891476_18378112552300923_3190078885325752590_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一家四口造訪北京環球影城，萬聖節鬼屋場景氣氛陰森神秘。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe1a1a3b394cb3e635652f300848578f/2026-10/SaveClip_App_862510702_18378112507300923_3734283970177428170_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨2019年離巢TVB。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/856dc98886e30ffca72d9518795916d7/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_26_07_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨2019年離巢TVB，近年轉移重心到內地。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e70bdcbb1c996d7f20a7b19e7539f337/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_26_05_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨難得回港拍劇，早前分享多張《法與情》的慶功相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4ff50b44c8f39b4d9457e6038d45d12/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_26_05_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨個樣依然係咁靚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d62a304fd02d17506ff18ca1b0f9750f/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_25_57_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樊少皇為老婆一起慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3892e973608cd332eee355ef699d4a73/2024-09/90fe3d39-9f68-4f6e-ba21-4ad8e57961b0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨與細女生日只差幾天，所以一齊慶祝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d39789f1339e00b02d48f825f03c1f33/2024-09/eb371183-67ff-4060-8f4d-0adb760252c8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨雖然已是兩女之母，但保養得宜，看不出已經43歲\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35f374830aa0e4c78a6d14301581bdf3/2026-02/_3_JJ___.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨長女跟媽媽成個餅印，也是天生美人胚子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1c0ed62fbf0c6a3b59b690d3412037e/2026-02/_1_JJ___.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨細女活潑可愛，樣子甚似爸爸樊少皇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd48b8778eca2605923a3b6f95fcf6e4/2026-02/_2_JJ___.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨與樊少皇育有兩女，但曾表示「一日要諗50次離婚」！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/370da2c168f777c2ef00ef097607b556/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_26_22_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>JJ賈曉晨讚女兒膽色過人</h2>\n<p>賈曉晨特意貼出樊少皇戴著骷髏面罩的相片，並打上「就是他」的箭嘴，但觀乎賈曉晨一家人大合照時的笑容，明顯是老夫老妻的打情罵俏，溫馨洋溢。網民除了留言同情賈曉晨遭遇外，更將焦點放在膽識過人的小飯兜身上，大讚她小小年紀全程陪媽咪勇闖多間恐怖鬼屋，賈曉晨更現身回應網民，指女兒十分大膽：「她還嫌不夠嚇人」。</p>\n<img alt=\"樊少皇與賈曉晨兩夫婦生下兩女後已很少二人世界。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/edb2f330b21d3d31166e019ef186650a/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_25_59_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩人屢傳婚變後又經常合體。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e78456313ea886f3727c6bfbbf41d2dc/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_25_59_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨有「回族」靚女基因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41a53342bdde778f5c1c61747853492c/2023-10/49df41a7ly1hia4fndg1tj21mt2g8hdu.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨2012年被爆與武打明星樊少皇拍拖。 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/667e0eff1fd27b0cb60de662229ffc59/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_26_01_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早前樊少皇與賈曉晨合體為細女慶生，一家人幸福溫馨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f9af3551009e06ca0fe9df16e8eda41/2026-09/_1_JJ___.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨細女「小飯團」在巨型「6」字氣球旁，一雙大眼睛萌爆全場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ae849105a70fe8c52ea372113441566/2026-09/_2_JJ___.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「小飯團」廣邀一眾好友開生日派對，大家圍着精緻的蛋糕，氣氛熱鬧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f76c9950e575445526b2ab88b74ba79b/2026-09/_3_JJ___.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「小飯團」合上雙眼，雙手合十虔誠許願，網民大讚她越大越靚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/58655bab91bef8ce9c0fe6047a7e43d7/2026-09/_4_JJ___.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"壽星女「小飯團」穿上紅色宮廷風公主裙，活脫脫是個古典小公主。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63e85c74772103dffc4f1a73db498aa8/2026-09/_5_JJ___.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「小飯團」的眉眼與輪廓，與爸爸樊少皇成個餅印，完美遺傳強大基因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82df5481254e93871143f4d51bf664bb/2026-09/_6_JJ___.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨三母女高顏值同框，大女「小飯兜」斯文漂亮，細女「小飯團」全程掛住食爆谷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83df6569583e167874cce5755cded3aa/2026-08/SaveClip_App_770302191_18363881899300923_7101272368507667012_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"細女在樂園標誌性的「THE MONSTERS」海盜船前留影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/78c1c4ff9883f474ac141920784061f0/2026-08/SaveClip_App_770182840_18363881674300923_4533636276078017230_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨與大女「小飯兜」的母女自拍，囡囡複製了美貌的美貌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6832d045f312a13077d036ae9d2c1bd9/2026-08/SaveClip_App_770976193_18363881860300923_4522715481487409225_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"細女「小飯團」也有文靜一面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8b1079892a933f0ce5b2bfeaefc1555/2026-08/SaveClip_App_771821167_18363881788300923_8210367817281502327_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨大女「小飯兜」的美貌被網民譽為「漫畫女主角」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e329b81992dfd0e3e9f8b15c1dad5d1/2026-08/SaveClip_App_772879545_18363881542300923_5583345697517893352_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨一家四口合照，樊少皇頓成大配角。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d4efb13c6fe8adf2b0213c259bc516d2/2026-08/SaveClip_App_773928941_18363881467300923_6152026409447419622_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"細女「小飯團」被媽媽賈曉晨捕捉到專心食爆谷的萌樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7653f56f402216755bf324df22704ef6/2026-08/SaveClip_App_774178633_18363881419300923_8317141086914634919_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨在樂園內與可愛的卡通裝置合照，少女心滿滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/323183ae5828826075f6da96272f5d81/2026-08/SaveClip_App_774313230_18363881890300923_6723536959737790028_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨與細女在巨型公仔前打卡，享受夏日親子樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa205e8a8075f70dfdf1011ff243c5d4/2026-08/SaveClip_App_774594313_18363881875300923_7520018400718743706_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨與樊少皇婚後多年來經歷不少風雨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9755bb2c415e50583b871641246728bf/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_26_01_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨與樊少皇2016年結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/827d874886ad2bab7f6086f228a11a81/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-03_at_9_26_01_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨於2017年誕下大女「小飯兜」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d76860a5ff94f6515010dc5832a63ea/2022-11/hkcAg5YCM6a-qFkXYP5rAAzQRcjVrG8xW_qpxVv6qcU.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"賈曉晨婚後先後誕下兩個女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3dfe3a34bfeb78b4fa01284ae56efecd/2023-01/WhatsApp_Image_2021-03-03_at_16_06_21.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大女小飯兜五官精緻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/302c95111488bb98de09c869c77be89a/2023-11/JJ1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小飯兜長得像混血兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/864958bdc1e2528ad02614114c946d86/2023-11/JJ2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨曾在小紅書上載拍攝細女「小飯團」迎接爸爸樊少皇的影片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/612e55e32e51ed336b8e4ee2aee1d095/2024-05/VS----0_00__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"父女齊歎雪糕，享受簡單溫馨時光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33a0dc56fee16c06f5a6c7ad8495e0a2/2024-05/VS----0_19__0.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:41:57.284219+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":638,"images":52,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:41.581179+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:46.134072+00:00","content_hash":"f93e983facd8911dcf2f3624441c8b6185d5ee2183763e1f3d928afc2683b47f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}